+        /// <summary>[ff9mapkit netsync s134] THE REPLAY TICK -- NetSyncClient.Update, every frame on both branches: transport right after
+        /// ActionTick, selftest right after ActionTickBench. The battle clock, the bit-5 latch, the hold-through count, the graces'
+        /// expiry; then the aborts (R8, W3), the running replays (natural ends, faults, END + 6 s, the 90 s cap, a gone actor), and
